@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Read reviews for a product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/reviews

### Submit a product review
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arta",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Material shumë i mirë dhe madhësi e saktë."
}

### Submit a contact message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Arta",
  "email": "arta@example.com",
  "message": "Kam një pyetje për porosinë time."
}

### Read contact messages (requires admin login cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/contact-messages